---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="sbp10positionloss">
  <div class="sbp10positionloss-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 274" role="img" aria-label="Bar chart: a 75.5% fall in one stock costs a portfolio 3.8%, 7.6%, 15.1% or 37.8% when the stock is 5%, 10%, 20% or 50% of it.">
      <text x="20" y="30" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>If one stock falls 75.5%, what the position size does to the whole portfolio</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nếu một mã giảm 75,5%, tỷ trọng quyết định danh mục mất bao nhiêu</tspan></text>
      <text x="238" y="82" class="b" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>5% of the portfolio in the stock</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>5% danh mục nằm ở mã đó</tspan></text>
      <rect x="250" y="60" width="42.3" height="32" class="bar-gold" />
      <text x="302.3" y="82" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>-3.8% of the portfolio</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>-3,8% danh mục</tspan></text>
      <text x="238" y="132" class="b" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>10% of the portfolio in the stock</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>10% danh mục nằm ở mã đó</tspan></text>
      <rect x="250" y="110" width="84.6" height="32" class="bar-gold" />
      <text x="344.6" y="132" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>-7.6% of the portfolio</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>-7,6% danh mục</tspan></text>
      <text x="238" y="182" class="b" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>20% of the portfolio in the stock</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>20% danh mục nằm ở mã đó</tspan></text>
      <rect x="250" y="160" width="169.2" height="32" class="bar-red" />
      <text x="429.2" y="182" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>-15.1% of the portfolio</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>-15,1% danh mục</tspan></text>
      <text x="238" y="232" class="b" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>50% of the portfolio in the stock</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>50% danh mục nằm ở mã đó</tspan></text>
      <rect x="250" y="210" width="423.1" height="32" class="bar-red" />
      <text x="683.1" y="232" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>-37.8% of the portfolio</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>-37,8% danh mục</tspan></text>
      <line x1="250" y1="52" x2="250" y2="252" class="axis" />
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Loss = position share x 75.5%. The fall is FLC from 14,600 VND (25 Mar 2022) to 3,570 VND (8 Sep 2022).</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Mức mất = tỷ trọng x 75,5%. Mức giảm là của FLC, từ 14.600 đồng (25/3/2022) xuống 3.570 đồng (8/9/2022).</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
   .sbp10positionloss { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp10positionloss-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
   .sbp10positionloss svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
   .sbp10positionloss text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
   .sbp10positionloss .t { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10positionloss .h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10positionloss .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10positionloss .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
   .sbp10positionloss .red { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10positionloss .green { fill: var(--act-2); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10positionloss .gold { fill: var(--act-1); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10positionloss .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
   .sbp10positionloss .card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10positionloss .card-green { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10positionloss .card-gold { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10positionloss .ln { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
   .sbp10positionloss .axis { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.2; }
   .sbp10positionloss .dash { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
   .sbp10positionloss .arw { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
   .sbp10positionloss .arw-h { fill: var(--text-muted); }
   .sbp10positionloss .bar-red { fill: var(--red); }
   .sbp10positionloss .bar-green { fill: var(--act-2); }
   .sbp10positionloss .bar-gold { fill: var(--gold); }
   .sbp10positionloss .bar-mut { fill: var(--text-faint); }
   .sbp10positionloss .path-line { fill: none; stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; }
   .sbp10positionloss .path-red { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; }
   .sbp10positionloss .dot { fill: var(--act-2); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1.5; }
   .sbp10positionloss .dot-red { fill: var(--red); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1.5; }
   .sbp10positionloss figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
